00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
A passing test can leave a requirement untested.
Actual local output, replayed with reading pauses.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
An arithmetic test passes without calling signup.
No linked receipt: UNTESTED.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:19,000
A requirement-linked check exposes the bug.
The recorded result is FAILED_CHECK.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:26,000
The toy fix passes two example assertions.
OBSERVED_PASS does not prove complete coverage.

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:33,000
A later source edit changes the fingerprint.
The previous evidence becomes STALE.

6
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Try the synthetic example and inspect the evidence.
